sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant G as "GL camera owner"
  participant M as "Main lease 와 epoch"
  participant W as "detectorExecutor"
  participant N as "primary native owner"
  participant S as "FastSAM model owner"
  participant P as "FastSAM post owner"
  participant U as "UI 와 D07 consumer"
  Note over G,U: F-D05-007 / P-D05-007 카메라 입장 및 F-D05-013 / P-D05-013 별도 unknown 수명주기
  G->>M: "F007 exactCPU receipt ownedYUV luma 복사"
  G->>G: "원 Image close"
  M->>W: "current epoch geometry sourcelease 와 pacingticket"
  W->>N: "F002 invoke watchdog800ms"
  opt "fresh unknown frame 선택"
    W->>S: "F013 ownedARGB token latestpending1"
    S->>P: "ownedrawoutput transfer"
    P->>P: "F014 decode 원 captureTTL 검사"
    P->>U: "F012 originallease 와 mask materialpoint"
  end
  N-->>W: "SUCCESS partial 또는 final"
  W->>M: "epoch geometry flight sourcelease 검사"
  alt "현재 소유와원 capture 신선"
    M->>U: "snapshot publication"
  else "stall 취소 회전 또는이전 epoch"
    M->>M: "late callback 폐기"
  end
  W->>M: "finally ticket 와 lease 해제"
  U->>M: "pause destroy invalidation"
  M->>N: "접수닫기 기존 native drain 후 close"
  M->>S: "closeAsync pending 폐기"
  S->>P: "진행중 consumer drain 확인"
  P-->>S: "consumer 완료"
  S->>S: "native owner 에서해제"
  S-->>M: "releasedFuture 결과와 releaseconfirmed"
